🧠 Key Takeaway
Conditional Formatting isn't simply about making spreadsheets colorful.

For a Data or Business Analyst, it can act as a lightweight visual analysis layer** that makes important information easier to detect.

=> Same Data → Clearer Signals → Faster Insights → Better Decisions

The important skill is not knowing where the Conditional Formatting button is.
It is knowing which business conditions deserve attention and how to represent them accurately.
